Subject: [RFC PATCH v2 02/12] mtd: rawnand: ams-delta: Use private structure
Date:   Tue,  7 Aug 2018 00:29:08 +0200
Message-Id: <20180806222918.12644-3-jmkrzyszt@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.16.4
In-Reply-To: <20180806222918.12644-1-jmkrzyszt@gmail.com>
References: <20180718235710.18242-1-jmkrzyszt@gmail.com>
 <20180806222918.12644-1-jmkrzyszt@gmail.com>
